28313      title 'Gasoline and Emissions Data';
28314      data gas;
28315      set sashelp.gas;
28316      if fuel in ('Ethanol', '82rongas', 'Gasohol');
28317      run;

NOTE: There were 171 observations read from the data set SASHELP.GAS.
NOTE: The data set WORK.GAS has 112 observations and 4 variables.

28318      ods graphics on;
28319      * Request a Spline Transformation of Equivalence Ratio;
28320      proc transreg data=Gas solve ss2 plots=(transformation obp residuals);
28321      model identity(nox) = spline(EqRatio / nknots=4);
28322      run;

NOTE: 2 observations were deleted from the analysis due to missing values.
NOTE: Algorithm converged.
NOTE: There were 112 observations read from the data set WORK.GAS.
NOTE: The PROCEDURE TRANSREG printed page 1751.

28323      * Separate Curves and Intercepts;
28324      proc transreg data=Gas solve ss2 additive plots=(transformation obp);
28325      model identity(nox) = class(Fuel / zero=none) |
28326      spline(EqRatio / nknots=4 after);
28327      run;

NOTE: Since the model contains SMOOTH, BSPLINE, PBSPLINE, or a CLASS expansion with ZERO=NONE, a model with an implicit intercept is fit.
NOTE: All statistics are mean corrected.
NOTE: 2 observations were deleted from the analysis due to missing values.
NOTE: Algorithm converged.
NOTE: There were 112 observations read from the data set WORK.GAS.
NOTE: The PROCEDURE TRANSREG printed page 1752.

28328      * Separate Intercepts;
