28337      title 'Introductory Main-Effects ANOVA Example';
28338      data a;
28339      input y x1 $ x2 $;
28340      datalines;

NOTE: The data set WORK.A has 12 observations and 3 variables.

28353      ;
28354      * Fit a main-effects ANOVA model with 1, 0, -1 coding;
28355      proc transreg ss2;
28356      model identity(y) = class(x1 x2 / effects);
28357      output coefficients replace;
28358      run;

NOTE: The data set WORK.DATA43 has 14 observations and 9 variables.
NOTE: The PROCEDURE TRANSREG printed page 1755.

